add_repository.description:
Paste the repository URL or 'owner/repo' and a **[fine-grained token]({fine_url})** limited to that repository (**Contents: Read-only**, nothing else). The token is used for this action only and is **not stored**.

Only annotated `vX.Y.Z` tags signed by a trusted key can be installed, and only into the folder you name. After an install **restart** Home Assistant (a reload is not enough).

{detail}
